questions.stem:
Write about 150 words on "Why Climate Health Is Gendered".

Use Lesson 6. Include:
- the two proportions (severity; women's socio-economic status);
- at least two concrete chains (heatwave Europe vs Chicago; Bangladesh waterlogging; biomass fuel and COPD; drought and male suicide);
- what equity requires (disaggregated data; accessible gender-equal systems).
